# Acme Industries
{.lead} A branded one-pager, page, and deck from a single source. The logo is the only brand input; the engine owns the rest.

```mdp:flow
Write the source -> Add brand-logo -> Compile to page, deck, and flyer
```

---

## What the logo can and cannot do
You supply one asset reference. The engine places it in the masthead at a locked size and position, flips it under right-to-left, and keeps type, color, and spacing exactly as the theme defines.

:::callout note
Swap the brand-logo value for your own SVG, a hosted URL, or a base64 data URI. An unsafe or missing value simply renders no logo, and the rest of the masthead is unchanged.
:::
